    "updated_at": "2026-03-02T22:35:41Z",
    "body": "Hi @bioyoshoo, \"ARTEFACT\" is ambiguous to me, and I am unsure which TE classification fits it better than \"repeat_fragment\", so the current default is probably good for now. \n\nHi @yaoxkkkkk, looks like your library contains clade-level classifications, which is not the convention of RepeatMasker library naming. You may want to strip off or reformat the clade information before feeding the library to EDTA2.\n\nThanks!\nShujun",
